        "# Load long-context prefix\n",
        "SWEEP_FILEPATH = \"/cns/sandbox/home/jiangwenqi/sweeps/llama-70b-longcontext-inference-prefix/\"\n",
        "SWEEP_NAME = \"llama-70b-longcontext-inference-prefix-sweep\"\n",
        "\n",
        "all_sweep_infos[SWEEP_NAME] = load_sweep_info(\n",
        "    sweep_path=SWEEP_FILEPATH,\n",
        "    print_memory=True,\n",
        "    is_retrieval=False,\n",
        "    clear_colossus_cahce=False,\n",
        "    return_pareto=True,\n",
        "    qps_cutoff=1.0,\n",
        "    num_chips_keep_power_of_two=True)\n",
        "    # qps_cutoff=0.95)\n",
        "\n",
        "plot_pareto_info(\n",
        "    df_pareto=all_sweep_infos[SWEEP_NAME],\n",
        "    is_retrieval=False,\n",
        "    constraints={'seq_len_inference_prefix': [1024 * 100, 1024 * 1000, 1024 * 10000]},\n",
        "    y_log=True\n",
        "  )"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "grXnEVLsksTZ"
      },
      "source": [
        "The disproportional slow down of LC versus RAG is because of the flops (still everything is compute-bound).\n",
        "\n",
        "For example, \"llama-70b-longcontext-inference-prefix-sweep\" with 1M tokens and a batch size of 1 requires 2.888967e+09 gflops / chip, which is 40K times higher than \"rag-70b-inference-prefix\" with a 512 prefix. So the QPS/chip also drops from 6.23 to 0.000159 (39K drop).\n",
        "\n",
        "From 100K context to 1M, flops/chip grows from 4.150656e+07 to 2.888967e+09."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "fFQLHBHbelzO"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "get_filtered_df(\n",
        "    all_sweep_infos[\"llama-70b-longcontext-inference-prefix-sweep\"],\n",
        "    {'seq_len_inference_prefix': [1024 * 10000]}\n",
        "  )[['batch_size', 'compute_flops', 'time_compute', 'num_chips', 'qps_per_chip']]"
      ]
