      "source": [
        "Heuristics:\n",
        "\n",
        "Speedup of latency-oriented to throughput-oriented database depends on Decode VS Retrieval Throuhgput Ratio (QPS).\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "batching ratio = decode batch size / iterative retrieval batch size\n",
        "\n",
        "E.g., for QPS ratio = 1, already notable speedup with batching ratio 2, e.g., 1.3x\n",
        "\n",
        "E.g., for QPS ratio = 10, batching ratio = 16, speedup ~1.2x"
      ]
    },
