        "1. If one just use the best size that saturates retrieval performance (batch size >= 32), the latency can be worse than using smaller batch sizes.\n",
        "  * This is more for smaller decode batch sizes, as gathering batch leads to higher % of idleness\n",
        "  * This is also more for less frequent retrieval (where waiting for batch cost is higher)\n",
        "2. For small decode batch size, if use inproper iterative batch size, the TBT can be larger than a larger decode batch size + the same iterative batch size."
      ]
